### Kickbase Insights configuration
###
### Copy to `.env` (next to docker-compose.yml, or into backend/ for local development).
### All variables use the 'KBI_' prefix, nested settings a double underscore (__).

### --- Logins -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Everyone logs in with their own Kickbase account and only sees their own leagues.
### League names or IDs this server is for, comma separated. Empty allows every league.
# KBI_AUTH__ALLOWED_LEAGUES="My League"
### League names or IDs that are never synced or shown, e.g. leagues in a different game mode like Arena.
# KBI_AUTH__BLOCKED_LEAGUES="My Arena League"
# KBI_AUTH__SESSION_DAYS=30
### Encrypts the stored Kickbase session tokens. Generated into the data folder when empty.
# KBI_AUTH__SECRET_KEY=

### --- Kickbase account (optional) ---------------------------------------------
### Keeps your leagues synced while nobody is logged in and collects the daily bonus.
# KBI_KICKBASE__EMAIL=you@example.com
# KBI_KICKBASE__PASSWORD=change-me
### The league this account keeps synced, listed first for everyone. Defaults to all of them.
# KBI_KICKBASE__LEAGUE=My League
### The instant the season started or your league was reset, ISO 8601 with UTC offset.
### Feed events before it are ignored. Without it the season start is estimated.
# KBI_KICKBASE__START_DATE=2026-08-01T18:00:00Z
### 50000000 for "Auslosung", 200000000 for "Ohne Team"
# KBI_KICKBASE__START_MONEY=50000000
### Competition ID (1 = Bundesliga)
# KBI_KICKBASE__COMPETITION_ID=1
### Collect the daily login bonus on every sync
# KBI_KICKBASE__COLLECT_BONUS=true
### Discord webhook for sync failures and collected bonuses
# KBI_KICKBASE__DISCORD_WEBHOOK=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...

### --- Sync ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Cron expression, evaluated in KBI_SYNC__TIMEZONE
# KBI_SYNC__SCHEDULE=10 2,6,10,14,18,22 * * *
# KBI_SYNC__TIMEZONE=Europe/Berlin
### How long live points are cached, in seconds
# KBI_SYNC__LIVE_CACHE_SECONDS=45

### --- Web server --------------------------------------------------------------
# KBI_API__HOST=0.0.0.0
# KBI_API__PORT=8000
### Proxies whose X-Forwarded-* headers are trusted, "*" behind Traefik/nginx in Docker
# KBI_API__FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS=127.0.0.1
### Leave the GET /api/health requests out of the logs
# KBI_API__HIDE_HEALTH_CHECKS=false

### --- Features (for custom rules) ------------------------------------------------------
### The estimated balances and max bids of the other managers, off by default
# KBI_ALLOW__BALANCES=false
### Kickbase user names or IDs who see them anyway, comma separated
# KBI_ALLOW__BALANCES_USERS="My Name,Another Name"

### --- Database ----------------------------------------------------------------
### Without a host, an SQLite database in KBI_DATA_DIR (/data in Docker) is used.
# KBI_DATABASE__HOST=postgres
# KBI_DATABASE__PORT=5432
# KBI_DATABASE__DATABASE=kickbase
# KBI_DATABASE__USERNAME=kickbase
# KBI_DATABASE__PASSWORD=change-me
### Or a full SQLAlchemy URL, which wins over the fields above:
# KBI_DATABASE__URL=postgresql+psycopg://user:password@host:5432/kickbase

### --- General -----------------------------------------------------------------
# KBI_DEBUG=false
### Run with generated sample data instead of a Kickbase account
# KBI_DEMO=false
